# BMRS / NESO settlement cache. A slim smoke-test subset (~45 MB) is committed so a
# fresh clone runs the offline demo and the day-level scripts without network access.
# The FULL multi-year cache (~1.2 GB) needed to reproduce the full-year and multi-year
# figures offline is archived on Zenodo (see README "Data & reproducibility"); it can
# also be re-fetched live from the key-free BMRS/NESO APIs. Ignoring untracked cache
# files keeps the 1.2 GB set out of the repo (already-tracked files stay tracked).
bmrs_cache/*

# Pipeline outputs (regenerated by reproduce_all.py; the small canonical CSVs
# -- annual_sample_*, neso_daily_*, sensitivity_*, pg_*, fullyear_* -- are committed.)
results_b6_*.csv
nonconvex_static.csv
reproduce_all.log

# Manuscript / paper artifacts — this is a code-only replication repo
cost-of-national-pricing.tex
cost-of-national-pricing.pdf
references.bib
fig_gbmap.pdf
fig_gbmap.png
highlights.txt
# Resubmission drafts, diffs and private review material (never committed here)
resubmission-*.tex
resubmission-*.pdf
resubmission-plan.md
reframe-notes.tex
feedback.pdf
gb-flexibility-ds-04-07/

# Internal — NOT for the public repository
cover_letter.*
*.docx
not-submission-related/

